import Mathlib

open Polynomial in
/- English proof (translation)
Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Expand and normalize the polynomial expressions, which then agree.
-/
private lemma eval_prod_add (m : Multiset ℂ) (u : ℂ) :
    (((m.map (fun x : ℂ ↦ -x)).map (fun x : ℂ ↦ X - C x)).prod).eval u
      = (m.map (fun x : ℂ ↦ u + x)).prod := by
  induction m using Multiset.induction_on with
  | empty => simp
  | cons a s ih =>
    simp only [Multiset.map_cons, Multiset.prod_cons, eval_mul, ih, eval_sub, eval_X, eval_C]
    ring

/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
